<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian employment target harder to reach - govt.</title>
<headline>Australian employment target harder to reach - govt.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Employment Minister Amanda Vanston said on Monday data showing falling job vacancies meant it would be harder for the government to achieve its employment growth forecast.</p>
<p>&quot;Anything that shows a reduction in vacancies obviously makes it a little bit more difficult,&quot; she told Australian Broadcasting Corp radio.</p>
</text>
